#: ../../reference/exchange-client.rst:2 aa59cd37263e43b7baf9b4c1bfe8317b
msgid "ExchangeClient"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/exchange-client.rst:6 841ec32005334533801c3518afa3a6e3
msgid ""
"This reference includes fund-moving, paid, authority-changing, outcome, "
"and validator actions. Some actions are irreversible and user-signed fund"
" actions have no ``expires_after`` protection. Do not invoke a method "
"from its signature alone. Read :doc:`../howto/orders`, "
":doc:`../howto/routing`, :doc:`../howto/transfers-administration`, and "
":doc:`../howto/lifecycle-reconciliation` first."
msgstr ""
"本参考包含资金转移、付费、权限变更、outcome 和验证者操作。一些操作不可逆，用户签名的资金操作没有 ``expires_after`` "
"保护。请勿仅依据方法签名调用方法。请先阅读 "
":doc:`../howto/orders`、:doc:`../howto/routing`、:doc:`../howto/transfers-"
"administration` 和 :doc:`../howto/lifecycle-reconciliation`。"

#: 87ae70eaa5da40078239c6842ae45043 async_hyperliquid.exchange.ExchangeClient:1
#: of
msgid "Transport-bound signed action client owned by ``AsyncHyperliquid``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/exchange-client.rst:17 4ea01d8a970545648c93aad42f271bbe
msgid ""
"Applications normally obtain this object from "
"``AsyncHyperliquid.exchange`` so it shares lifecycle, transport, routing,"
" and nonce ownership with the root client."
msgstr ""
"应用程序通常从 ``AsyncHyperliquid.exchange`` 获取此对象，使其与 root client 共享生命周期、传输、路由和"
" nonce 所有权。"

#: ../../reference/exchange-client.rst:22 2b55dd170d944586a54272fa32a0771c
msgid "Shared contract"
msgstr "共享契约"

#: ../../reference/exchange-client.rst:24 bd7027f9bed448a7a2401b5ed4400eeb
msgid ""
"Do not construct this class directly. ``AsyncHyperliquid`` supplies the "
"account, signer, network, routing scope, transport, and monotonic nonce "
"owner."
msgstr "不要直接构造此类。``AsyncHyperliquid`` 会提供账户、签名者、网络、路由作用域、transport 和单调 nonce 所有者。"

#: ../../reference/exchange-client.rst:26 6c9c120ce83844fdaed13101c9ef6f8e
msgid ""
"Amounts are human-readable units. USD sends, withdrawals, and class "
"transfers truncate beyond 2 decimals; vault USD uses 6 decimals; HYPE "
"uses 8; and token transfers use token metadata. See :doc:`../howto"
"/transfers-administration`."
msgstr "数量使用人类可读单位。USD 发送、提现和类别转账会截断超过 2 位的小数；vault USD 使用 6 位小数；HYPE 使用 8 位；token 转账使用 token 元数据。参见 :doc:`../howto/transfers-administration`。"

#: ../../reference/exchange-client.rst:29 fff88967225743e495d74ff069b17388
msgid ""
"``expires_after`` is an absolute millisecond deadline and is available "
"only where shown in the signature. It rejects a stale submission; it does"
" not undo an acknowledged action or make an ambiguous timeout safe to "
"retry."
msgstr "``expires_after`` 是绝对毫秒期限，并且只在签名中显示的位置可用。它会拒绝过期提交；不会撤销已确认操作，也不会让不确定的超时变得可以安全重试。"

#: ../../reference/exchange-client.rst:32 985da21854ff41c589f7fec51caa1f1c
msgid ""
"Default acknowledgements still return ``status == \"err\"`` for Exchange "
"rejection. Order, cancel, and TWAP methods also contain operation-"
"specific status data. Always discriminate the union described in :doc"
":`response-types`."
msgstr "Exchange 拒绝时，默认确认仍会返回 ``status == \"err\"``。订单、取消和 TWAP 方法还包含操作特定的状态数据。始终区分 :doc:`response-types` 中描述的联合类型。"

#: ../../reference/exchange-client.rst:36 93cec0f7cefc45cbaa8a41cc7327c90d
msgid ""
"These methods do not automatically retry. Reuse one client per execution "
"address and follow :doc:`../howto/lifecycle-reconciliation` after "
"uncertain outcomes."
msgstr "这些方法不会自动重试。每个执行地址复用一个客户端，并在结果不确定后遵循 :doc:`../howto/lifecycle-reconciliation`。"

#: ../../reference/exchange-client.rst:40 4ad193188d1a4abbba46bb9a524375c3
msgid ""
"The signatures below are the authoritative parameter and return-type "
"reference; the linked how-to guides supply the operation-specific safety "
"procedure."
msgstr "下方签名是参数和返回类型的权威参考；链接的 how-to 指南提供操作特定的安全流程。"
